WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Add the source files to Documents.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In Arrange, drag documents into order.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Switch to All pages and rotate sideways pages.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Continue to review and export one PDF.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Save the combined PDF.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.800
Open the exported file and check its pages.
